        "original_id": "6f5fb103-9901-5ff1-9de2-bac7a08b6add",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sigourney Weaver\n- Roles: Ellen Ripley\n- Products: Annie Hall, Alien, Aliens, Alien 3, Alien Resurrection\n- Topics: Alien film series\n\nFacts:\n- Sigourney Weaver made her film debut in a minor role in \"Annie Hall\" in 1977.\n- Sigourney Weaver rose to prominence with her first lead role as Ellen Ripley in \"Alien\" in 1979.\n- Sigourney Weaver reprised Ellen Ripley in \"Aliens\" in 1986.\n- Sigourney Weaver was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Actress for \"Aliens\" in 1986.\n- Sigourney Weaver reprised Ellen Ripley in \"Alien 3\" in 1992.\n- Sigourney Weaver reprised Ellen Ripley in \"Alien Resurrection\" in 1997.\n- \"Alien Resurrection\" is the fourth installment in the Alien film series.\n- \"Alien Resurrection\" is the final installment in the original Alien film series.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "a043d10a-8c92-558d-8890-a13f06c3144d",
        "text": "Page: Sigourney Weaver. Sentence: Following her film debut as a minor character in \"Annie Hall\" (1977), she quickly came to prominence with her first lead role as Ellen Ripley in \"Alien\" (1979).\nPage: Sigourney Weaver. Sentence: She reprised the role in three sequels: \"Aliens\" (1986), for which she was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Actress; \"Alien 3\" (1992), and \"Alien Resurrection\" (1997).\nPage: Alien Resurrection. Sentence: It is the fourth installment in the \"Alien\" film series, and the final installment in the original series.",
